   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Write the difference quotient: \\( \\lim_{h \\to 0} \\frac{f(-1 + h) - f(-1)}{h} \\), with \\( f(-1 + h) = 3 h^{2} - 8 h - 1 \\) and \\( f(-1) = -1 \\).",
